# the quality of [[feeling]] bitter; [[acrimony]], [[resentment]]

====Synonyms====
* (''quality of being bitter in taste''): [[acerbicness]], [[acridity]], [[acridness]]
* (''quality of feeling bitter''): [[acrimony]], [[gall]], [[rancor]]/[[rancour]], [[resentment]]

